  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'jewber: uber for jews', which serves as the central hateful concept of the meme. The text explicitly constructs a derogatory stereotype ('jewber') and frames it as a service for Jews, which the user is implicitly invited to internalize or identify with as the target of the joke. The projection is onto the textual material because the meme's hateful message is conveyed through this text, and the user is expected to engage with the concept presented in the text.",
